```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Client accepts freelancer offer\non a Tender] --> B[Create Order\nstatus: PENDING_PAYMENT]

    B --> C[Review and Pay screen]

    C -->|Payment success| D[Order ACTIVE\nIn progress\nFunds in ESCROW]
    C -->|Payment failed| E[Payment failed\nShow error and retry]
    C -->|Client cancels| X[CANCELLED_UNPAID\nOrder closed]

    E --> C

    D --> F[Work in progress\nChat and files]

    F --> G[Freelancer clicks Deliver work]

    G --> H[DELIVERED_PENDING_REVIEW\nDelivered, waiting for review]

    H --> I[Client chooses action]

    I -->|Approve and release| J[Release payment\nOrder COMPLETED]
    I -->|Ask for changes| F
    I -->|Open dispute| K[Order DISPUTE\nAdmin review]

    H --> L[No client action for X days\nAuto complete]
    L --> J

    K --> M{Admin decision}
    M -->|Refund client| N[Order REFUNDED]
    M -->|Pay freelancer| J
    M -->|Split escrow| O[Order RESOLVED_SPLIT]
```
